## 💳 3. Direct Parent Checkout Funnel Layout

The payment architecture targets high-level parent concerns, positioning the platform as an efficient financial alternative to traditional tutoring.

*   **Value Proposition:** Frames the subscription pricing (\$29/month) around direct financial savings compared to traditional human tutoring fees (\$150+/hour) or the long-term cost of retaking college credits.
*   **Real-Time Performance Dashboard:** The parent landing page features an immediate performance summary tracking the student's progress against target scores:
    > 📊 **Current Readiness Status:** David is currently pacing toward a **Score 3**. Unlocking the remaining modules targets specific logic gaps in Unit 4 and Unit 6 to help lift his trajectory toward a **Score 5**.
*   **One-Click Checkout Optimization:** Integrates pre-configured Stripe elements that match mobile payment methods (such as Apple Pay and Google Pay). This reduces friction and allows parents to complete purchases in seconds from any automated text notification.
